# Monitoring Stack – TechWave DevOps Platform

## Overview

This directory contains the complete observability platform implemented for the TechWave DevOps Platform project.

The monitoring stack follows Cloud Native best practices and provides capabilities for:

- Metrics collection
- Centralized logging
- Distributed observability
- Alerting and notifications
- Infrastructure monitoring
- Kubernetes monitoring
- Application monitoring
- Dashboard visualization

---

